<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy" %>
<div class="page-head">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="muted">ReplyDesk · Effective 27 July 2026</p>
</div>

<div class="card" style="max-width:820px; line-height:1.7;">
  <p>ReplyDesk (“we”, “us”) is a customer-support tool that lets a business connect its Facebook Page and Instagram professional account to receive messages, send automated replies, and let a human agent respond. This policy explains what we collect and why.</p>

  <h3>Information we collect</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Facebook/Instagram account data</strong> — when you connect a Page, we receive your name, the Pages you manage, Page access tokens, and any linked Instagram Business Account ID, via Facebook Login for Business.</li>
    <li><strong>Messages</strong> — the content of messages sent to and from your connected Pages, delivered to us through Meta’s webhooks and Graph API, so we can display conversations and send replies on your behalf.</li>
    <li><strong>Customer profile data</strong> — for people who message your Page, we may receive their name, profile picture, locale, and a page-scoped ID (PSID) to display the conversation to your agents.</li>
    <li><strong>Operational logs</strong> — records of webhook events and delivery status for reliability and debugging.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>How we use it</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>To provide the core service: showing conversations, matching automated FAQ replies, and letting a human agent respond (including replies sent within Meta’s 7-day Human Agent window).</li>
    <li>To operate, secure, and troubleshoot the service.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell your data, and we do <strong>not</strong> use message content for advertising. Automated and human replies are only sent in response to a customer’s own inquiry.</p>

  <h3>Sharing</h3>
  <p>We share data only with Meta Platforms as required to send and receive messages through the Messenger and Instagram APIs, and with infrastructure providers that host the service on our behalf. We disclose information if required by law.</p>

  <h3>Retention &amp; deletion</h3>
  <p>We keep connected-account and conversation data only as long as your account is active or as needed to provide the service. You can disconnect a Page at any time from the Connections page, and you can request deletion of your data — see our <a href="/data-deletion" style="color:var(--primary-color);">Data Deletion instructions</a>.</p>

  <h3>Security</h3>
  <p>Access tokens and conversation data are stored on secured servers and access is restricted to the account owner and their agents.</p>

  <h3>Your rights</h3>
  <p>You may access, correct, or delete your data, and revoke ReplyDesk’s access to your Pages at any time via your <a href="https://www.facebook.com/settings?tab=business_tools" style="color:var(--primary-color);">Facebook Business Integrations settings</a>.</p>

  <h3>For Meta App Reviewers / testers</h3>
  <p>Data accessed during App Review or testing is used solely to demonstrate the app’s functionality and is not retained beyond what is necessary to evaluate the integration. Test conversations and any connected test Page can be removed on request.</p>

  <h3>Contact</h3>
  <p>Questions or data requests: <strong>klangtech_dev_02@googlegroups.com</strong>. <span class="muted">(Replace with your business support address before going live.)</span></p>
</div>
